@SmartXAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5198
### Register a sensor
POST http://localhost:5198/api/sensors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceMacAddress": "00:1B:44:11:3A:B8",
  "deploymentLocation": "Facility A/Zone 1/Sub-Zone B",
  "category": 0
}

### Get registered sensors
GET {{SmartXAPI_HostAddress}}/api/sensors
Accept: application/json

